        /// <summary>Fields to remove, since `null` keeps a value. `match_reason` removes the reason, `action_refund` removes the whole refund, `action_refund_cap_cents` only the per-order cap, `action_close_outcome` stops the rule closing tickets. Clearing a field you also change returns `422` on `clear`.</summary>
